<title>USA: SOS Staffing to buy Texas personnel co.</title>
<headline>SOS Staffing to buy Texas personnel co.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SOS Staffing Services Inc said on Tuesday that it agreed to acquire Key Personnel Service of Amarillo, Texas for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>Key Personnel, which has annualized revenues of more than $1 million, provides clerical and light industrial temporary services, SOS said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
